  "description": "The clinical record is identified by the UUID\u202f123e4567\u2011e89b\u201142d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174000 with extension\u202f9a5b6c7d\u20111e2f\u20115a34\u2011b567\u201189abcdef0123. A validation error was flagged at the top level (RULE\u2011001, version\u202fmyRule:1.2.3) with code\u202fE001 and the message \u201cTop\u2011level error example\u201d.\n\nThe patient linked to this record carries the identifier patientRoot\u2011001\u202f/\u202fpatientExt\u2011ABC. One molecular marker is attached, bearing the identifier 223e4567\u2011e89b\u201132d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174111 (extension\u202faa5b6c7d\u20112e2f\u20115b34\u2011c567\u201189abcdef1234), and it includes an observation organizer identified by 323e4567\u2011e89b\u201152d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174222 (extension\u202fbb5b6c7d\u20113e2f\u20115c34\u2011d567\u201189abcdef2345).\n\nA single encounter is recorded with identifier 423e4567\u2011e89b\u201142d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174333 (extension\u202fcc5b6c7d\u20114e2f\u20115d34\u2011e567\u201189abcdef3456). Within this encounter a procedure is logged (identifier\u202f523e4567\u2011e89b\u201152d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174444, extension\u202fdd5b6c7d\u20115e2f\u20115e34\u2011f567\u201189abcdef4567), a condition is noted (identifier\u202f623e4567\u2011e89b\u201112d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174555, extension\u202fee5b6c7d\u20116e2f\u20115f34\u2011a567\u201189abcdef5678), and an observation organizer is attached (identifier\u202f723e4567\u2011e89b\u201132d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174666, extension\u202fff5b6c7d\u20117e2f\u20115a34\u2011b567\u201189abcdef6789). The encounter also generated a warning (WARN\u2011001, version\u202fmyRule:2.0.0) with code\u202fW001, the message \u201cEncounter warning\u201d, and a timestamp of 2023\u201108\u201115T14:30:00+02:00.\n\nOutside the encounter, the record includes an additional procedure (identifier\u202f823e4567\u2011e89b\u201142d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174777, extension\u202faa5b6c7d\u20118e2f\u20115b34\u2011c567\u201189abcdef7890) and a top\u2011level observation organizer (identifier\u202f923e4567\u2011e89b\u201152d3\u2011a456\u2011426614174888, extension\u202fbb5b6c7d\u20119e2f\u20115c34\u2011d567\u201189abcdef8901)."
